Subject: [PATCH] mms: bound blocked upload socket writes on the carrier network

Preserve network-specific DNS, sockets, proxies and carrier timeouts. Use the
carrier timeout (60 seconds if nonpositive) for SO_SNDTIMEO so a large POST
cannot wait indefinitely after its peer stops accepting data. No APN mapping.

--- a/src/com/android/mms/service/MmsHttpClient.java
+++ b/src/com/android/mms/service/MmsHttpClient.java
@@ -21,6 +21,10 @@
